1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,563
Pembangkit nuklir terapung

2
00:00:01,583 --> 00:00:02,859
untuk Halmahera.

3
00:00:02,879 --> 00:00:04,485
Padahal, aturan kita masih

4
00:00:04,505 --> 00:00:05,677
mengartikan lokasi nuklir

5
00:00:05,697 --> 00:00:07,038
sebagai daratan.

6
00:00:07,058 --> 00:00:08,369
Pada 16 Oktober,

7
00:00:08,389 --> 00:00:09,948
Rosatom dari Rusia meneken

8
00:00:09,968 --> 00:00:10,908
kontrak listrik dengan

9
00:00:10,928 --> 00:00:12,385
perusahaan swasta Indonesia.

10
00:00:12,405 --> 00:00:13,748
Isinya dua kapal pembangkit,

11
00:00:13,768 --> 00:00:15,495
total 200 megawatt.

12
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:17,105
Pemerintah belum memutuskan,

13
00:00:17,125 --> 00:00:18,158
izin operasi pun belum

14
00:00:18,178 --> 00:00:18,945
diajukan.

15
00:00:18,965 --> 00:00:20,498
Jantungnya reaktor kecil.

16
00:00:20,518 --> 00:00:22,154
Neutron menabrak inti uranium

17
00:00:22,174 --> 00:00:23,114
hingga terbelah,

18
00:00:23,134 --> 00:00:25,189
melepas panas dan 2–3 neutron

19
00:00:25,209 --> 00:00:25,771
baru.

20
00:00:25,791 --> 00:00:26,762
Batang kendali menyerap

21
00:00:26,782 --> 00:00:27,598
neutron berlebih,

22
00:00:27,618 --> 00:00:29,415
supaya reaksi tetap stabil.

23
00:00:29,435 --> 00:00:31,033
Air di sekitar bahan bakar

24
00:00:31,053 --> 00:00:32,628
dipompa bertekanan tinggi,

25
00:00:32,648 --> 00:00:34,748
jadi tidak mendidih walau

26
00:00:34,768 --> 00:00:35,720
ratusan derajat.

27
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,190
Panasnya diteruskan ke sirkuit

28
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:38,482
kedua yang terpisah,

29
00:00:38,502 --> 00:00:40,646
airnya berubah menjadi uap.

30
00:00:40,666 --> 00:00:42,385
Uap memutar turbin,

31
00:00:42,405 --> 00:00:44,284
turbin memutar generator,

32
00:00:44,304 --> 00:00:45,615
sama seperti pembangkit batu

33
00:00:45,635 --> 00:00:46,271
bara.

34
00:00:46,291 --> 00:00:48,153
Bedanya hanya sumber panas.

35
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:49,206
Listriknya mengalir lewat

36
00:00:49,226 --> 00:00:50,275
kabel ke daratan.

37
00:00:50,295 --> 00:00:50,987
Air lautnya?

38
00:00:51,007 --> 00:00:52,736
Hanya mendinginkan uap bekas

39
00:00:52,756 --> 00:00:54,083
di kondensor,

40
00:00:54,103 --> 00:00:56,003
tanpa menyentuh air reaktor.

41
00:00:56,023 --> 00:00:57,148
Air laut kembali sedikit lebih

42
00:00:57,168 --> 00:00:57,646
hangat.

43
00:00:57,666 --> 00:00:59,191
Itulah dampak rutinnya.

44
00:00:59,211 --> 00:01:00,476
Pembangkit ini dirakit di

45
00:01:00,496 --> 00:01:01,869
galangan, lalu ditarik kapal

46
00:01:01,889 --> 00:01:02,612
tunda.

47
00:01:02,632 --> 00:01:03,974
Ini bukan yang pertama:

48
00:01:03,994 --> 00:01:05,104
Akademik Lomonosov,

49
00:01:05,124 --> 00:01:06,974
2 × 35 megawatt,

50
00:01:06,994 --> 00:01:08,754
beroperasi di Arktik Rusia

51
00:01:08,774 --> 00:01:10,053
sejak 2020.

52
00:01:10,073 --> 00:01:11,833
Rencananya, tiap 12 tahun ia

53
00:01:11,853 --> 00:01:13,108
ditarik pulang ke galangan.

54
00:01:13,128 --> 00:01:14,904
Kini BAPETEN merevisi aturan,

55
00:01:14,924 --> 00:01:16,111
agar lokasinya juga bisa di

56
00:01:16,131 --> 00:01:17,040
perairan.

57
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:18,418
Ikuti AUDIRA untuk cara kerja

58
00:01:18,438 --> 00:01:19,348
berikutnya.

